EDGAR: Efficient Diffusion-Driven Gaussian Avatar Refinement via Synthetic Failure
Kwan Yun, Min-Hyeok Bang, Colette Suhjung Koo, and Junyong Noh.

EDGAR modifies the diffusion network with reference conditioning and six-expert
feed-forward modules, and supplies training and avatar-refinement interfaces.
